  "title": {
    "rendered": "سورة الشرح مكتوبة بخط كبير: 8 آية مع الترجمة الإنجليزية"
  },
  "content": {
    "rendered": "<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">نقدم سورة الشرح مكتوبة بخط كبير، وعدد آياتها 8، مع تلاوة صوتية آية بآية.</p>\n\n\n<div style=\"background-color: #EAEAEA; padding: 15px; text-align: center;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic', Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0;\">بِسْمِ اللَّهِ الرَّحْمَٰنِ الرَّحِيمِ</h2>\n</div>\n\n\n<p><script type=\"text/javascript\">\n  function changesoundy(ID) {\n    var sound_id = document.getElementById(\"quran_player_by_sora\");\n    sound_id.innerHTML = '<div style=\"margin-top:15px;\"><audio controls autoplay><source src=\"'+ID+'\" type=\"audio/mpeg\">متصفحك لا يدعم عنصر الصوت</audio><br /><a href=\"'+ID+'\">تنزيل الملف</a></div>';\n  }\n</script><h2 class=\"sora_title\">سورة الشرح</h2><div id=\"quran_player_by_sora\"></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/094001.mp3');\">أَلَمْ نَشْرَحْ لَكَ صَدْرَكَ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">الشرح [1]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/094002.mp3');\">وَوَضَعْنَا عَنكَ وِزْرَكَ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">الشرح [2]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/094003.mp3');\">الَّذِي أَنقَضَ ظَهْرَكَ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">الشرح [3]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/094004.mp3');\">وَرَفَعْنَا لَكَ ذِكْرَكَ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">الشرح [4]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/094005.mp3');\">فَإِنَّ مَعَ الْعُسْرِ يُسْرًا <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">الشرح [5]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/094006.mp3');\">إِنَّ مَعَ الْعُسْرِ يُسْرًا <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">الشرح [6]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/094007.mp3');\">فَإِذَا فَرَغْتَ فَانصَبْ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">الشرح [7]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/094008.mp3');\">وَإِلَىٰ رَبِّكَ فَارْغَب <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">الشرح [8]</span></div></div></p>\n",
    "protected": false
  },
